      "Original": "Secrets adds the rest of the previously hidden features which were\neither unintuitive or forcing specific rotations for small benefits.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "隐藏分类收录了其余原先隐藏的功能。\n这些功能通常不够直观，或要求特定循环才能获得小幅收益。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
