    {
      "Original": "They are also designed to bring QoL improvements to some jobs.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "部分功能也可让某些职业的操作更方便。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They are intuitive, and aim at considerably reducing button bloating.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "它们更直观，可以大幅减少按键。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They are meant to be used by anyone, whatever their reasons may be.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "任何玩家都可按需使用。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They are meant to be used to give accessibility options to everyone.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "任何有简化操作需求的玩家都可使用。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They are niche options, and probably pointless for most players.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "它们适用于特定场合，多数玩家无需启用。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They generally require a heavy knowledge of your job.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "通常需要深入了解自己的职业。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They often lead to an unintuitive behavior or specific rotation routes.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "操作可能不直观，或需使用特定技能循环。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They usually aim at further reducing button bloating.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "这些功能通常能进一步减少按键。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "They will often lower your ability to perform well in high-end content.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "这些选项通常会限制你在高难度副本中的表现。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "This is the first time you're using the new version of XIVCombo Expanded.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "这是你第一次使用新版 XIVCombo Expanded。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Those combos are additional features absent in original XIVCombo.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "这些额外的连击功能在原版 XIVCombo 中没有提供。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Those combos are non-optimal routes which simplify a rotation overall.",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "这些连击用简化后的技能循环换取更容易的操作。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Those combos are optimization routes which give little benefits.",
