      "Original": "What's new?",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "更新内容",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "With the introduction of new combos and features, an ever-growing list of jobs,\nthis plugin ended up having to be reworked for better UI & clarity.",
