      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "随着连击功能和支持职业逐渐增多，\n插件重新设计了界面，方便查找和使用各项功能。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "You can check them out below, actually. How neat!",
      "Context": "OneTimeModal.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BulletText",
      "Translated": "可以在下方预览这些变化。",
      "Source": "library"
